%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5e51bd241bb14ca9ad943bd95325d4ca, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialScript
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialTexts
  texts:
  - tutorialName: pickingUp
    tutorialText: You can pick up most objects by pressing LMB on them. You can only
      hold one item at the time. To drop item press RMB, E or ESC. Item will be dropped
      where you're looking if it's in your range.
  - tutorialName: interact
    tutorialText: 'You can interact with some items by pressing E on them. Here are
      some of them:

      Table placer - find correct place and unpack tables for
      customers to start coming.

      Minigames - get into "minigame view" and
      follow instructions.

      Storage - get one item from storage

      Seat
      in front of caravan - control snail.'
  - tutorialName: cooking
    tutorialText: When interacting with kitchen tools, you cannot move and instead
      operate with your mouse. To complete the minigame, firstly bring all correct
      ingredients and follow instructions on screen.
  - tutorialName: dish
    tutorialText: When making dishes (indicated by dropdown in the corner) you need
      to select the recipe you want to prepare bring all processed ingredients e.g.
      sliced bread, cheese and follow instructions on screen.
  - tutorialName: caravan
    tutorialText: Press W to move the snail forward. Press A or D to steer. When
      you control snail, whole caravan is moving behind and you can enter it at any
      time.
  - tutorialName: customer
    tutorialText: When you interact with customer, they go to any available table.
      They will wait for their order (shown obove their head and also on the top
      left of your screen), but if you take too long or mess up the order they will
      leave and you will lose some money.
  - tutorialName: highlight
    tutorialText: Hold F button to highlight every object that you can interact with.
  - tutorialName: moving
    tutorialText: 'Press WASD to move. Press Space to jump. Use your mouse to look
      around. Hold ESC to open pause menu.

      All keybinds are shown on the bottom
      left corner.'
  - tutorialName: start
    tutorialText: Hello! You are an elf, who takes care of The Walking Tavern. Every
      time you do something for the first time you will recieve this kind of message.
      While following the path collect as many ingredients as you can, put them in
      storage boxes inside the caravan and procced by reaching the end (indicated
      by progress bar on the bottom). You can reset tutorials from options menu.
